message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Copernican"
version: "12.0.26"
date-released: "2026-06-02"

abstract: >-
  Copernican is a package-first Python toolkit for evaluating cosmological
  models against SNe Ia, BAO, and CMB observations, with bundled engines,
  models, validation helpers, and a native declared-graph CMB engine shipped
  under the `copernican/` package. External scientific-reference solvers are
  development dependencies rather than production runtime requirements.

